{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 11, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Dear Participants\n\nI am writing to formally invite you to a meeting that will be taking place on Friday at 2 PM in the conference room on the second floor of our headquarters building. The purpose of this meeting is to discuss the recent trends that have been observed in our industry and how they are correlated with the changes in our company's performance over the past quarter.\n\nAs you are aware our company has been experiencing a period of significant growth and expansion and it is essential that we come together as a team to discuss the challenges and opportunities that this growth presents. The meeting will provide a platform for us to share our experiences and insights and to work together to identify the key drivers of our success.\n\nDuring the meeting we will be reviewing the latest data on our sales and revenue figures and analyzing the factors that are contributing to our growth. We will also be discussing the strategies that we can implement to sustain this growth and to continue to drive our business forward. It is essential that we are all on the same page and that we are working towards the same goals and objectives.\n\nI am confident that this meeting will be a valuable opportunity for us to come together and to share our knowledge and expertise. I am expecting a lively and engaging discussion and I encourage each and every one of you to come prepared to share your thoughts and ideas. We will be covering a number of key topics during the meeting including our current sales performance and our plans for future growth.\n\nThe meeting will be led by our CEO who will be presenting an overview of our current situation and outlining the key challenges and opportunities that we are facing. We will also be having a number of guest speakers who will be sharing their insights and expertise on the latest trends and developments in our industry. I am sure that you will find their presentations informative and thought-provoking.\n\nIn preparation for the meeting I would like to ask that you review the attached documents which provide an overview of our current sales data and revenue figures. I would also like to encourage you to come prepared with any questions or comments that you may have. We will be having a Q&A session during the meeting and I encourage you to participate fully.\n\nThe meeting is expected to last for approximately two hours and we will be providing refreshments and snacks for all participants. I would like to thank you in advance for your participation and I look forward to seeing you all on Friday at 2 PM.\n\nIf you are unable to attend the meeting please let me know as soon as possible so that we can make alternative arrangements. I appreciate your cooperation and understanding in this matter and I am confident that together we can achieve great things.\n\nThe agenda for the meeting is as follows:\n\n* Introduction and welcome by CEO\n* Presentation on current sales data and revenue figures\n* Guest speaker presentations on latest trends and developments in our industry\n* Q&A session\n* Discussion on strategies for future growth and expansion\n* Review of key action items and next steps\n\nI am excited to be experiencing this period of growth and expansion with all of you and I am confident that our collective efforts will continue to drive our business forward. I look forward to seeing you all on Friday.\n\nThank you for your continued hard work and dedication.\n\nSincerely\n[Your Name]", "logprobs": [{"token": "Dear", "logprob": -1.701413869857788}, {"token": " Participants", "logprob": -0.4919816851615906}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.00033384948619641364}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.20147541165351868}, {"token": " am", "logprob": -0.12694275379180908}, {"token": " writing", "logprob": -0.0005581013392657042}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}